IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CHUNKED-MULTITENANT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TENANTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-CAPACITY      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FAIR-BUDGET         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SLO-COMPLIANCE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CHUNKED-MULTITENANT.
    IF NUM-TENANTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE TOTAL-CAPACITY TO FAIR-BUDGET.
    DIVIDE NUM-TENANTS INTO FAIR-BUDGET.
    IF FAIR-BUDGET == 0
        MOVE 256 TO FAIR-BUDGET.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 99 TO SLO-COMPLIANCE.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FAIR-BUDGET.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-TENANTS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
